## 3. Architecture & major components

- High-level components and how they fit together.
- Data flow between components.

## 4. Security & privacy requirements

- Authentication/authorization needs.
- Data classification, storage, retention.
- Anything that cannot be logged or shared.

## 5. Supported tool & dependency versions

