## 6. Non-goals

Explicitly what this project does NOT do (prevents scope creep and
uncontrolled rewrites).

## 7. Acceptance criteria

"Make it work" is not useful. Each criterion must be observable and checkable:

- [ ] Criterion 1 (with the test or manual check that proves it)
- [ ] Criterion 2
- [ ] Criterion 3
